       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. P-35-TRIM-SPACES.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 X PIC X(8) VALUE "ABC     ".
01 I PIC 9 VALUE 8.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
PERFORM UNTIL I = 0 OR X(I:1) NOT = SPACE SUBTRACT 1 FROM I END-PERFORM
IF I > 0 DISPLAY X(1:I) ELSE DISPLAY "EMPTY" END-IF
STOP RUN.
